# Exposure target scopes and optional regex gates.
# Concrete domains here are expanded into config/sources/exposure.dorks templates.
# Wildcards and regex lines are broad allow-gates by default; they admit
# Collector-discovered concrete domains without generating noisy site:* queries.
# Set EXPOSURE_EXPAND_WILDCARD_TARGETS=1 only for an intentional broad sweep.
*.edu.sg
*.sg
*.com
*.me
*.kr
*.*
regex:.*
